WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:02.501
-Who doesn't love
Reese Witherspoon?

00:00:02.501 --> 00:00:03.868
-Oh.
-Welcome back...

00:00:03.868 --> 00:00:05.300
