00:00:08.067 --> 00:00:09.634
Thanks so much for coming on.

00:00:09.634 --> 00:00:12.534
I'm so happy to see you
in person in the holidays.

00:00:12.534 --> 00:00:15.100
-Last time I saw you was on
Zoom, and it was just so...

00:00:15.100 --> 00:00:16.534
