it was as another great one.

00:03:08.434 --> 00:03:10.467
And I just binged out too,
because I just went crazy.

00:03:10.467 --> 00:03:12.534
And then big twist.

00:03:12.534 --> 00:03:14.601
-Big twist?
-Oh, yeah.

00:03:14.601 --> 00:03:16.200
-Oh, yeah.
-You know what I'm taking about.

00:03:16.200 --> 00:03:18.167
