[ Laughter ]

00:03:18.167 --> 00:03:19.834
Oh.

00:03:19.834 --> 00:03:21.901
Oh, yeah. Okay.

00:03:21.901 --> 00:03:24.000
Oh, right. Yes.

00:03:24.000 --> 00:03:25.801
-Big twist.

00:03:25.801 --> 00:03:27.133
Big twist for me, man.

00:03:27.133 --> 00:03:28.367
Oh, my gosh.
Anyway.

00:03:28.367 --> 00:03:30.067
-Did you recover, though?
You're okay?

00:03:30.067 --> 00:03:31.701
-I loved it.
I loved every second of it.

00:03:31.701 --> 00:03:33.000
I did not see that thing coming.

00:03:33.000 --> 00:03:34.033
-Yeah, you're right,
you're right,

00:03:34.033 --> 00:03:35.234
